# Mosquitto Access Control List (ACL)
# Enforces Principle of Least Privilege across MQTT telemetry channels.

# Sensor Fleet / Edge Simulators:
# Can ONLY publish telemetry to individual sensor topics.
# Forbidden from subscribing to topics or accessing administrative channels.
user iot_simulator
topic write iot/sensors/+

# Backend Ingestion & Stream Processing Service:
# Subscribes to telemetry stream from all sensors.
# Permitted to publish to device control and notification topics.
user iot_backend
topic read iot/sensors/#
topic readwrite iot/control/#
topic readwrite iot/alerts/#
